1
00:00:00,489 --> 00:00:01,707
Ia tertidur,

2
00:00:01,727 --> 00:00:03,301
lalu bangun dan mengira baru

3
00:00:03,321 --> 00:00:04,049
sehari.

4
00:00:04,069 --> 00:00:05,519
Padahal seratus tahun telah

5
00:00:05,539 --> 00:00:07,045
berlalu, makanannya masih

6
00:00:07,065 --> 00:00:08,671
segar, dan keledainya tinggal

7
00:00:08,691 --> 00:00:09,200
tulang.

8
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:11,057
Surah Al-Baqarah ayat dua

9
00:00:11,077 --> 00:00:12,203
ratus lima puluh sembilan.

10
00:00:12,223 --> 00:00:14,123
Seorang laki-laki melewati

11
00:00:14,143 --> 00:00:15,562
sebuah negeri yang runtuh,

12
00:00:15,582 --> 00:00:17,188
atap-atapnya sudah rata dengan

13
00:00:17,208 --> 00:00:18,116
puing, dan tak ada satu

14
00:00:18,136 --> 00:00:18,820
penghuni pun.

15
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,585
Ia berhenti dan bergumam,

16
00:00:20,605 --> 00:00:21,802
bukan karena ragu,

17
00:00:21,822 --> 00:00:22,940
tapi ingin melihat:

18
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,054
bagaimana Allah menghidupkan

19
00:00:24,074 --> 00:00:25,045
kembali negeri ini setelah

20
00:00:25,065 --> 00:00:25,705
hancur?

21
00:00:25,725 --> 00:00:27,082
Lalu Allah mematikannya selama

22
00:00:27,102 --> 00:00:28,243
seratus tahun,

23
00:00:28,263 --> 00:00:29,265
kemudian membangkitkannya

24
00:00:29,285 --> 00:00:29,868
kembali.

25
00:00:29,888 --> 00:00:31,147
Ditanyakan kepadanya:

26
00:00:31,167 --> 00:00:32,587
berapa lama engkau tinggal di

27
00:00:32,607 --> 00:00:33,205
sini?

28
00:00:33,225 --> 00:00:34,242
Ia menjawab:

29
00:00:34,262 --> 00:00:36,058
